B.ao0=new A.I(371,B.XZ)
B.X3=s(["Fixed: you can type into a fresh new note again \u2014 its tap target was too thin to focus. It\u2019s a comfortable size now (still not tall).","The Listening player is now two rows: the current item\u2019s overview on top, the play controls below. Tap the overview (\u25ce) to jump the list back to whatever\u2019s playing."],t.s)
